        <mxCell id="foundation" value="Foundation:  Orchestrator and batch runner  ·  Config and secrets (.env, Jira/Xray API tokens)  ·  Observability (logs, cost, timing)  ·  CI/CD (GitHub Actions)&#10;Persistence:  IR store  ·  Spec repo (git)  ·  Run history / flakiness  ·  Fix Memory (RAG of past patches)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1b2531;strokeColor=#1b2531;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
